.git
.github
bin
dist
docs
console/node_modules
console/dist
*.md
!entrypoint.sh

# internal/console/dist is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the built console,
# and embedding it is the whole point (R-253, one binary includes the UI).
# Excluding it made `go build` fail inside the image — go:embed fails outright
# when its pattern matches nothing — so the image could not be built at all.
!internal/console/dist
!internal/console/dist/**
